# Payment gateway API — manual test requests
# Use with the VS Code "REST Client" extension (humao.rest-client):
# click "Send Request" above any block. Or copy the curl equivalents below.
#
# Prereqs:
#   1. cp .env.example .env  and set PAYSTACK_SECRET_KEY="sk_test_xxxxx" (TEST key)
#   2. npm run start:server   ->  "Server running on port 4000"

@base = http://localhost:4000
@email = test@example.com
# Capture a reference here after a real test checkout to verify it below:
@reference = REPLACE_WITH_PAYSTACK_REFERENCE


### Health check (GET) — no Paystack key required
GET {{base}}/api/health


### Create donation intent (POST) — happy path, returns { checkout_link }
# amount is in NAIRA (server multiplies by 100 to kobo). Min ₦1.
POST {{base}}/api/create-donation-intent
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "amount": 500,
  "session_token": "sess_local_1"
}


### Create donation intent — missing fields (expect 400, no key needed)
POST {{base}}/api/create-donation-intent
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}"
}


### Create donation intent — invalid amount (expect 400)
POST {{base}}/api/create-donation-intent
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "amount": -10,
  "session_token": "sess_local_1"
}


### Verify donation (GET) — needs a real reference from a completed test checkout
GET {{base}}/api/verify-donation?reference={{reference}}


### Verify donation — missing reference (expect 400)
GET {{base}}/api/verify-donation


# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# curl equivalents (run in a terminal):
#
#   curl -i http://localhost:4000/api/health
#
#   curl -i -X POST http://localhost:4000/api/create-donation-intent \
#     -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
#     -d '{"email":"test@example.com","amount":500,"session_token":"sess_local_1"}'
#
#   curl -i "http://localhost:4000/api/verify-donation?reference=YOUR_REF"
#
# Paystack test card: 4084 0840 8408 4081 — any future expiry, any CVV, OTP 123456
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
